i’m looking for a second set of eyes to help diagnose the issues I am having with my SEM model:

Here is my SEM code:
sem.model <- '
#Latent Variables
latent_edu =~ Education
#Observed Variables
latent_edu ~ Sexuality_Straight + Racialized_Minority + Age.in.years + Gender_Women + Gender_Minority
